<title>SINGAPORE: MMI debuts at S$0.53, vs S$0.52 IPO price.</title>
<headline>MMI debuts at S$0.53, vs S$0.52 IPO price.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in disk drive components-maker MMI Holdings Ltd opened at Singapore $0.53 on their first morning of trading on Wednesday, up only slightly from their initial public offer (IPO) price of S$0.52.  </p>
<p>MMI shares then rose to a high of S$0.56 before slipping back to steady at around S$0.53.</p>
<p>MMI's offer of 69.12 million shares was subscribed 4.22 times, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
